                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4827271f-55d6-44d5-8614-1ba29391e83a",
                        "entry_id": "f1739a4e-6ad8-35fa-a34e-695dca965fbc",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "réparateur"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5e6daafa-a738-3465-aeb7-1fc10c547ea7",
                        "entry_id": "f1739a4e-6ad8-35fa-a34e-695dca965fbc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celle qui répare."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c391f1b2-dff6-4805-9d95-41fef8cbe140",
                                "sense_id": "5e6daafa-a738-3465-aeb7-1fc10c547ea7",
                                "text": "N’oublions pas non plus de rappeler que derrière ces figures féminines transparaît un des visages de la mère, non plus la boiteuse, mais la réparatrice de dentelles anciennes, du moins dans l’imagination de Céline."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "21b7757b-73ad-43a9-acb3-051cad5a200f",
                                "sense_id": "5e6daafa-a738-3465-aeb7-1fc10c547ea7",
                                "text": "Elle est au service de la puissance, elle ne la corrige pas : elle n’est ni la réparatrice du lien social rompu, ni la génératrice de configurations culturelles inédites donnant son sens au présent et éclairant le devenir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3596a658-f92b-4d65-b327-0916b4e277f3",
                                "sense_id": "5e6daafa-a738-3465-aeb7-1fc10c547ea7",
                                "text": "Tu verras, je te reviendrai en bon état, enfin juste assez déréglé pour que tu puisses à nouveau exercer tes talents de réparatrice sur moi."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "861746c0-f211-4c81-9efe-442fce468622",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1739a4e-6ad8-35fa-a34e-695dca965fbc",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e6daafa-a738-3465-aeb7-1fc10c547ea7",
                        "target_lang_word": "Reparateurin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bcb92b10-db6a-491d-afc0-6e465eedb64b",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1739a4e-6ad8-35fa-a34e-695dca965fbc",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e6daafa-a738-3465-aeb7-1fc10c547ea7",
                        "target_lang_word": "repairer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "repairer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0651a210-810e-34c0-85ad-8be3acb1e73b",
                                        "entry_id": "21f97bc8-450d-3ead-b102-906dd437c2d0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person who repairs things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "592238de-7589-4e9a-8f70-46bac1b8492c",
                                                "sense_id": "0651a210-810e-34c0-85ad-8be3acb1e73b",
                                                "text": "And they that shall be of thee shall build the old waste places: thou shalt raise up the foundations of many generations; and thou shalt be called, The repairer of the breach, The restorer of paths to dwell in."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b833f3ad-5c0e-4234-ae17-9b98d27e7219",
                                                "sense_id": "0651a210-810e-34c0-85ad-8be3acb1e73b",
                                                "text": "The men on the freight trains, who go over the whole length of the road, bow to me as to an old acquaintance, they pass me so often, and apparently they take me for an employee; and so I am. I too would fain be a track-repairer somewhere in the orbit of the earth."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2a860351-5c57-4b6c-900c-ce25e82fa2ef",
                                                "sense_id": "0651a210-810e-34c0-85ad-8be3acb1e73b",
                                                "text": "1987, Nadine Gordimer, A Sport of Nature, New York: Alfred Knopf, p. 168,\nWhere the European city grid of right angles was overgrown and broken up by the purposeful tangle of African pursuits—the shortest point-to-point meander taken on foot between barbers and fruit-sellers, scribes and bicycle repairers—to be white was to feel invisible; only a sensuous self-assurance, while it lasted, could counter that."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f65cdd21-ff56-4ebb-9c15-b1af2a4258e0",
                        "source_entry_id": "f1739a4e-6ad8-35fa-a34e-695dca965fbc",
                        "source_sense_id": "5e6daafa-a738-3465-aeb7-1fc10c547ea7",
                        "target_lang_word": "repairperson",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "repairperson",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "caeed615-58b2-3af7-a1f7-bea012754b83",
                                        "entry_id": "0036aebe-b2ea-3981-ba8e-2811cc2f3428",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of repairer, a person who repairs things."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ccecff35-92db-47f7-bdda-1e4eb30d3160",
                                                "sense_id": "caeed615-58b2-3af7-a1f7-bea012754b83",
                                                "text": "A repairman and his truck. Guess I should say repairperson. Could have been a gal under that uniform and cap."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1678346d-ba94-4ff1-8039-ee35f09f26c4",
                                                "sense_id": "caeed615-58b2-3af7-a1f7-bea012754b83",
                                                "text": "Now the chintzy nameplate is all that distinguishes his work space from those of the photocopier repairperson, diet food company, and kitchen designer down the hall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1558686a-e3c4-4788-a494-a652da6ab481",
                                                "sense_id": "caeed615-58b2-3af7-a1f7-bea012754b83",
                                                "text": "As part of the settlement of a discrimination complaint filed after a 70-year-old transgendered Verizon repairperson was repeatedly arrested for using women's bathrooms at Grand Central Station in New York City, the Metropolitan Transportation Authority agreed in October to let people use the train station bathroom that's \"consistent with their gender expression.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
